ModuleDocComment 0..95 "//! Calling what implements `lang.ops.Call` (spec 02, section 4): through borrows of a function"
Whitespace 95..96 "\n"
ModuleDocComment 96..194 "//! or a closure, and inside a generic function, whose `$F: lang.ops.Call((), R)` is inferred from"
Whitespace 194..195 "\n"
ModuleDocComment 195..293 "//! the constraint its own parameter was declared with, or from a struct's impl; `()` passed where"
Whitespace 293..294 "\n"
ModuleDocComment 294..334 "//! a type is expected is the unit type."
Whitespace 334..336 "\n\n"
